# Projects smoothapt ingests, one per line:
#
#   <github-repo>  <archive>  <suite>  <workflow>  <check>
#
# archive   reprepro archive under /var/lib/smoothapt/archives (served as
#           /<archive>/): "public", or "smoothrouter" for the per-user one.
# workflow  the workflow file whose attestations a package must carry; any
#           other signer (another repo, another workflow, a PR run) is refused.
# check     "attestation": the package's build-provenance attestation must
#           verify against the public Sigstore log (public repositories).
#           "actions-upload": a private repository, whose attestations are not
#           in that log; the release and package must have been uploaded by
#           GitHub Actions, with the digest GitHub recorded. Needs the token in
#           /etc/smoothapt/github-token.
#
# Every release the workflow publishes is ingested, prereleases included:
# a build from main reaches the archive with no manual step.
RakuenSoftware/smoothkernel   public        common        release.yml  attestation
RakuenSoftware/smoothrouter   smoothrouter  smoothrouter  release.yml  actions-upload
RakuenSoftware/smoothfs       public        smoothnas     release-please.yml  attestation
RakuenSoftware/smoothnas      public        smoothnas     release.yml  attestation
